    <string name="guide_intro">Under each Bengali letter is what to type on the Latin keyboard. See \"Hard-to-type letters\" for ৎ, ঁ, ং, ঃ, ড় and য়. The suggestion bar also fixes common slips, such as a missing ঁ or ৎ.</string>
