    <string name="guide_section_tips">Tips</string>
    <string name="guide_tips">• Capital letters give a different letter: t → ত, T → ট; d → দ, D → ড; n → ন, N → ণ; s → স, S → শ.\n• Type a word the easy way (তড়িত): the suggestion bar offers the correct spelling (তড়িৎ).\n• Words you pick or type twice are remembered. Clear them in Settings.</string>
